68553-00-4.name_en:
Fuel oil, No 6;
Heavy Fuel oil;
[A distillate oil having a minimum viscosity of 900 SUS at 37.7 °C (100 °F) to a maximum of 9000 SUS at 37.7 °C (100 °F).]

68607-30-7.name_en:
Residues (petroleum), topping plant, low-sulfur;
Heavy Fuel oil;
